	"AuthorLabel": "Kokomi fanclub_Prybli Dephne520 Dasora777 mssrble",
	"Description": "This is a school project made by 4 people. It's not completely finished since it does not have cut scenes/heart events. Other than that you can romance the characters like normal. :) There are 7 romancable characters and 1 interactable npc.\u00A0To start the mod you start a new farm or it functions the next day if you play in an alredy excisting savefile. To get to the area you walk to the backside of the bus at the busstop.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />Our school project is about how to do good representation in games with the help of the players! As part of our project we would love to get some feedback from players on the mod, we have linked a survey for anyone who would like to answer it. Thank you for taking your time to try the mod out or read this message! :D\n<br />\n<br />https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfSrrkDM4PGkkye_9Vww3mFN8xCH-O8MtBsm_cpLT4YWS4zxQ/viewform?usp=header\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />If you notice any bugs notify us and we will see what we can do. Have in mind that this is the first mod we have ever made and none of us have programmed before.\n<br />We will update the mod when we have time and feel like it.\n<br />\n<br />We haven't tested how compatible this is with other mods so we dont know. But these have been reported that our mod is not compatible with:\n<br />Axolotl Village\n<br />Ancient History - A Museum Expansion mod",
